# The `film` tier is a BUILD ARTIFACT, not a source.
#
# Full-camera plates (3264px) for the 4K master: ~250 MB across 162 frames × 2
# kinds. Git ships `browse` (512) and `screen` (1024) — 28 MB, which is what the
# browser needs and what the payload budget allows. The film tier is rebuilt on
# whatever machine renders the film, from originals verified and hydrated into
# pipeline/.work/raw by the private asset contract:
#
#     pipeline/4_corpus.py --tiers film --skip-room
#
plates/film/
mattes/film/

# Its manifest entry, kept out of the shipped manifest for the same reason.
manifest.local.json
tier-receipts/film.json
